fire in me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000011c0:text","row":26105,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「そーですか」","en":"“Oh, really?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009536","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00048","en":"Taichi: \"Dooo you now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000013e8:text","row":26106,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら、うちでは客は床に寝るんだ」","en":"“In this house, guests sleep on the floor.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009537","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00049","en":"Taichi: \"Come on, guests in this house sleep on the floor.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001447:text","row":26107,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ううう、床がかたいと眠れないのに……けち」","en":"“...But I can’t sleep on a hard floor... cheapskate.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009538","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00050","en":"Touko: \"...ngggh, the floor's hard and I can't sleep on it... tightwad.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001497:text","row":26108,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「女の子が横に寝てたら、一晩中Ｈな悪戯し続けるしかない」","en":"“If a girl sleeps next to me, I’ll have no choice but to grope her all night.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009539","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00051","en":"Taichi: \"If a girl were to sleep next to me, there would necessarily be continued sexual mischief all night long.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000150c:text","row":26109,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「しかないって……」","en":"“No choice...?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009540","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00052","en":"Touko: \"Necessarily...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001540:text","row":26110,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「眠れないんだったら、好きな部屋のベッド使っていいからさ」","en":"“If you really can’t sleep, pick any other bed in the house.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009541","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00053","en":"Taichi: \"If you can't sleep there, then you can use the bed in any room you like.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000015b7:text","row":26111,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ぅー」","en":"“...Nnngh.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009542","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00054","en":"Touko: \"...(nnngh.)\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000015ed:text","row":26112,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"悩んでいる。","en":"She agonized over it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009543","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00055","en":"Worried.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001611:text","row":26113,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"瞳が切ない感じだ。","en":"Her eyes looked forlorn.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009544","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00056","en":"I can feel the misery in her eyes.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000163b:text","row":26114,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"俺も心も切ない感じだ。","en":"My heart felt forlorn too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009545","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00057","en":"I can feel the misery in my heart, as well.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001671:text","row":26115,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふ、不服かね？」","en":"“D-do you object?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009546","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00058","en":"Taichi: \"Di-, dissatisfied?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000016c0:text","row":26116,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「いい……ここで、寝るわよ」","en":"“Fine... I’ll sleep here.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009547","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00059","en":"Touko: \"Fine... I'll sleep here, yes!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000016f4:text","row":26117,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"くそ、可愛いな。","en":"Damn, she was cute.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009548","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00060","en":"Dammit, so cute.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000171c:text","row":26118,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"離れて寝たくないんだな。","en":"She didn’t want to sleep apart from me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009549","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00061","en":"I don't want to sleep away from her,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000174c:text","row":26119,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"けど甘くしたら駄目。","en":"But I couldn’t be too sweet to her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009550","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00062","en":"but if I spoil her she'll get problematic.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001778:text","row":26120,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子はどんどん駄目になっていく。とろけていってしまう。","en":"Touko was growing softer and softer. Melting away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009551","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00063","en":"Touko would grow steady and quickly into uselessness. She would completely melt.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000017c6:text","row":26121,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"まるで飴玉のように。","en":"Like a piece of hard candy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009552","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00064","en":"Just like she's candy.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000017f2:text","row":26122,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"だからゆっくりゆっくり、時間をかけてなめる。","en":"So I had to lick her slowly, slowly, taking my time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009553","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00065","en":"That is why I will lick slowly but slooowly, taking my time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001836:text","row":26123,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"……なくならないように。","en":"...So she wouldn’t disappear.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009554","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00066","en":"...so as not to make her disappear.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000188b:text","row":26124,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一、適度に厳しい」","en":"“...Taichi. Just strict enough.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009555","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00067","en":"Touko: \"...Taichi, you're pretty unsparing.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000018bd:text","row":26125,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"まさに。","en":"Exactly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009556","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00068","en":"Very much so.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000018e5:text","row":26126,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「おやすみー」","en":"“Good night.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009557","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00069","en":"Taichi: \"G'niiight.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001930:text","row":26127,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「かたい……いたい……くすん」","en":"“So hard... it hurts... sniff.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009558","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00070","en":"Touko: \"Hard... hurts... sob.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001966:text","row":26128,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"床に敷いた薄い布団に、身を横たえた。","en":"She lay down on the thin futon spread across the floor.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009559","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00071","en":"She lies down over a thin futon spread out on the floor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:000019a2:text","row":26129,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"俺も横になる。","en":"I lay down too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009560","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00072","en":"I lie down as well.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001a9e:text","row":26130,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"シン、と空気が静まった気がした。","en":"The air went utterly still.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009561","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00073","en":"It felt like things had grown audibly quiet.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001ad6:text","row":26131,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"窓から星の光が、無数の柱となって櫛目を作る。","en":"Countless shafts of starlight streamed through the window, row upon row like the teeth of a comb.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009562","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00074","en":"The lights of the stars become countless colonnades that comb the room from the window.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001b1a:text","row":26132,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"別世界のようだった。","en":"It was like another world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009563","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00075","en":"It was as if a different world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001b6b:text","row":26133,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「ねえ……太一……」","en":"“Hey... Taichi...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009564","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00076","en":"Touko: \"Say... Taichi...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001b97:text","row":26134,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"背中が語る。","en":"Her back spoke to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009565","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00077","en":"Words from my back.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001bd5:text","row":26135,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Mm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009566","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00078","en":"Taichi: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001c1a:text","row":26136,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずっと一緒に、いられるのかな……」","en":"“Do you think... we’ll always be together?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009567","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00079","en":"Touko: \"Will we always be able to be... together, I wonder...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001c5e:text","row":26137,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"「イヤって言っても、まとわりついてやる」","en":"“Even if you say you don’t want me, I’ll stick to you like glue.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009568","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00080","en":"Taichi: \"Even if you said you don't want to, I'd still be coiled all around you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001cc3:text","row":26138,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ふふ、だったら平気かな」","en":"“...Hee hee. Then I think I’ll be okay.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009569","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00081","en":"Touko: \"...heheh, then we should be alright I guess.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001d01:text","row":26139,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしてそんなことを？」","en":"“What makes you ask?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009570","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00082","en":"Taichi: \"Where's this coming from?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001d58:text","row":26140,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって、人が消えたのよ？　私たちだっていつか……」","en":"“Because everyone disappeared. Someday we might...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009571","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00083","en":"Touko: \"Because, people have vanished right? So, someday the two of us too...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001dac:text","row":26141,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“......”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009572","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00084","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001df1:text","row":26142,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「消えるなら、せめて一緒がいい……のに……」","en":"“If we disappear... I want us to disappear together, at least...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009573","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00085","en":"Touko: \"If we do disappear, at least if we're together... it'd...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001e35:text","row":26143,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子は眠った。","en":"Touko fell asleep.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009574","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00086","en":"Touko was asleep.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001e5b:text","row":26144,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"一緒、か。","en":"Together, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009575","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00087","en":"Together, then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001e7d:text","row":26145,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"深く考えたことはなかった。","en":"I’d never given it much thought.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009576","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00088","en":"I had never given it deep thought,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001eaf:text","row":26146,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"人がいなくなったことについて。","en":"About everyone being gone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009577","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00089","en":"to that idea of people not being there anymore.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001ee5:text","row":26147,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"なぜ消えたのか？","en":"Why did they disappear?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009578","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00090","en":"Why did they vanish?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001f0d:text","row":26148,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"いかにして消えたのか？","en":"How did they disappear?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009579","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00091","en":"In what way did they vanish?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001f3b:text","row":26149,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"説明できる材料は何もない。","en":"There was nothing to go on.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009580","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00092","en":"I have no materials whatsoever to be able to explain this.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001f6d:text","row":26150,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんだって、何も言ってこないんだ。わからないに違いない。","en":"Youko hadn’t said a word about it, either. She must not know.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009581","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00093","en":"Youko-chan herself didn't say a word about this, either. She doesn't know, no mistake.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00001fc3:text","row":26151,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女をもってしても、原因を予測することさえできない。","en":"Even she couldn’t so much as guess at the cause.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009582","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00094","en":"Even making use of her, merely estimating a cause is impossible.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000200f:text","row":26152,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"窓から夜空を眺めた。","en":"I looked out the window at the night sky.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009583","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00095","en":"I gazed at the night sky out the window.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:0000203b:text","row":26153,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"だからこの八人で、生きていくしかない。","en":"So the eight of us just had to keep living.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009584","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00096","en":"That is why there is no choice but to live together for the eight of us.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0153:00002079:text","row":26154,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"傷つけたり、好きあったりしながら。","en":"Hurting one another. Loving one another.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009585","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2017:00097","en":"While hurting each other, while loving each other.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
